nk-id-v2=3D"1bLFfAUL" target=3D"_blank">smart toilets</a>, equipped with ca=
meras that can analyze photos of users=E2=80=99 waste to assess gut health.=
 Startup Throne&nbsp;makes one, as does Kohler.&nbsp;<br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Recently, technologist Simon Fondrie-Teitler =
<a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWzPQV6THpSwW2=
fF-__5C_X3KW2lg-cV5H4G_qN80643x2-ZW0W7Y8-PT6lZ3m3W5FPR4_8m9ztHW7d1W4c5990H4=
W8Xdsh85rdW_bW5TljfK3V6_nlW4JTw7X7lHclNW35D9TN3dwHfHW8HkMB16gVmk0MQTB12lm_n=
0N7fvgmYdR1j6W6s53VS9d1Hd3W2Z7CZs6Qs4yzV2Qpwc5Hs9k0W1xTZTm7Rpl36VqXdwC6b3rv=
