d-v2=3D"wc0SLclu" target=3D"_blank">alleged</a> the data Kohler collects is=
 not =E2=80=9Cend-to-end encrypted,=E2=80=9D as the company claimed, so her=
e=E2=80=99s a less intrusive toilet innovation: devices that mask bathroom =
noise.<br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-weight: bold; font-size: =
18px;">In 1979=E2=80=A6</span><br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">=E2=80=A6 toilet distributor Orihara Manufact=
uring launched Etiquettone, a device that served as both a deodorizer and a=
 noisemaker. It was wildly popular, especially because it saved water amid =
a drought in Tokyo, <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q=
-Vf04/VWzPQV6THpSwW2fF-__5C_X3KW2lg-cV5H4G_qN80643d2-ZW0W7lCdLW6lZ3l9W50qfp=
Y2qjGgCW4lQtTd8t3LsJW6NqGxq7Z_23NW9kjnDK7w9wQQW2lM-0C6QRv2zVdwhXw6xKlDGN2V3=
