jywdnm5K5pW3_np7T1cNF-YW3snVsC3J65JnW1QW_cR3Mk2vxW7vNlfG4T3ZxsVdvHHq4HtY3RV=
9ssFW5Ywk0ZW11z81R6V7cxrW6n9QjD4WtgyvN8D4wKHMmG0xW3jCTP-7D1ys_W5Gvcpb2TbrN9=
f2p4n8j04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=
=3D"nJ7WksyX" target=3D"_blank">per</a> <span style=3D"font-style: italic;"=
>The New York Times</span>.&nbsp;<br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Why? Well, people often flushed to cover up a=
ny embarrassing noises they might make while using public toilets, then flu=
shed again when they were finished. The Etiquettone got people to only flus=
h when needed. <br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Orihara never secured a patent for the invent=
ion, so other companies =E2=80=94 including toilet maker Toto Ltd. =E2=80=
=94 began making their own.<br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-weight: bold; font-size: =
18px;">Today=E2=80=A6</span><br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">=E2=80=A6 such devices are catching on outsid=
e of Japan, with companies offering devices that play a variety of sounds =
=E2=80=94 nature noises, music, gunfire, etc.</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">Australian entrepreneur Donna Burke released Royal Flu=
shh with a Japanese manufacturer. It attaches to the wall and plays nature =
sounds. Burke told the <em>NYT</em> that one customer, annoyed with her hus=
band=E2=80=99s bathroom noise, called the device a =E2=80=9Cmarriage saver.=
=E2=80=9D <br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">Toilet manufacturer Lixil partnered with Roland to cre=
ate a motion-activated device that adjusts sound frequency as needed. <br><=
br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">Faux Fan is a <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t=
/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWzPQV6THpSwW2fF-__5C_X3KW2lg-cV5H4G_qN80642l2-ZW0W5BW=
0B06lZ3l7W5DWX1j6---F9W3KNgvJ68gsr5W3v3fwR1TZzkRN6RHPxXwn2tqW1jBMRZ7N8ksVW6=
XH7WY2N_HfqW6v0wvh1vht0JW8pwff131ltZyW1K67Hx1_mN7bN79fzMtmYRF_N3_pWzG90z89W=
4RcqHm5QR43FW2FRnc-3YsfbXW6fmbp-3s5lvxW5gLsvt6ndZqqW1Fgv4G6sYs9hMzTpZsH5q_b=
VqfvL48syrwjf1qNVxH04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-h=
s-link-id-v2=3D"qZDXF3oX" target=3D"_blank">portable</a> noisemaking device=
 you can travel with, such as when sharing a hotel room or Airbnb. (Another=
 way to save water, as some people might otherwise run the faucet.) <br><br=
></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">Loodio is a <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/C=
tc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWzPQV6THpSwW2fF-__5C_X3KW2lg-cV5H4G_qN80643d2-ZW0W7lCdL=
W6lZ3mCW2s5ymG45vHZjW4qQ4H-59LHspW8fxvw-7x8HXWW2n2X3G5GCtfSW4fmc416wdJkWW43=
9Hbc2JCNRgN6tJGfccf3tRW3vJ5yp3vsPN8W5x8nqC2HJmxZN9c_35pcY1XGW6PKmCF3L7W7wW2=
